 a new Accounting Period, click the&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(18, 51, 76); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\">+ Accounting Period</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(18, 51, 76); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">&nbsp;button.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The from and to periods show the starting and ending dates of the accounting period. The status shows whether the accounting periods are locked or unlocked. The Action drop-down allows you to delete an accounting period also you may cease a particular accounting period.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250627653/original/NXCABl5gVZISEikYIbehYC70Qr44E7Tcjg.png?1782483828\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250627653\"></span></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><br></h4><h4 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Add Accounting Period and click save</span></h4><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9101524189/original/6y86zHdX-Npqp8pz-U2kBA8EdPJ9QF57Dw.png?1588347442\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9101524189\"></span><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !impo